{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2022-09-29 06:00:00', 'title': "LOWE'S AND SAMSUNG TRANSFORM APPLIANCES INTO WORKS OF ART WITH LIMITED-EDITION SAMSUNG BESPOKE REFRIGERATOR PANEL COLLECTION", 'text': "THE THREE CUSTOM REFRIGERATOR PANEL STYLES, CREATED BY ARTISTS ALEXA MEADE, AMBER VITTORIA AND DOMONIQUE BROWN, AVAILABLE NOW EXCLUSIVELY AT LOWE'S MOORESVILLE, N.C. , SEPT. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TO OFFER SHOPPERS ANOTHER WAY TO CUSTOMIZE THEIR SPACES AND EXPRESS THEIR UNIQUE PERSONAL STYLE, LOWE'S AND SAMSUNG ARE LAUNCHING TODAY A LIMITED-EDITION COLLECTION OF PANELS FOR SAMSUNG'S BESPOKE 4-DOOR FRENCH DOOR REFRIGERATOR, DESIGNED BY THREE DISTINCTIVE ARTISTS."}